Package: pve-csi-copy
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, pve-manager, perl
Description: token-authorised copy-volume endpoint for proxmox-csi-plugin
 Registers a permission-gated "POST .../storage/{storage}/csi-copy" API method into
 pvedaemon/pveproxy so the proxmox-csi-plugin migration controller can copy
 volumes between storages with a scoped API token instead of root@pam.
 .
 It touches no Proxmox-shipped file and fails safe: if PVE internals change, the
 endpoint simply does not register and the daemons start normally. Access is
 gated by PVE's own ACL (Datastore.Audit + per-volume check on the source,
 Datastore.AllocateSpace on the target).
